<p><p>Shaam e ghurbat..(2)<br />
hai ummul masaeb laqab aapka<br />
to mai bint e mazloom e karbobala<br />
tamache lage mera daaman jala<br />
magar dil ko ghum hai to is baat ka<br />
kai roz se aap soyi nahi<br />
ke baba ko jee bhar ke royi nahi..(2)<br />
sakina ye kehti rahi raat bhar, phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>Zara der ghazi mujhe maankar, phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye<br />
sakina ye kehti rahi raat bhar, phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>1. Batate the daadi ki baatein mujhe<br />
sulate the baba bade pyaar se<br />
magar chand lamho ke is waqt ne<br />
mujhe rann mein itne tamache lage<br />
ke ab shamiyo ka nahi koi darr<br />
phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>2. Najaf ki taraf dekhiye to zara<br />
ye taapo ki aati hai kaisi sada<br />
bhala kis tarah saamne jayengi<br />
phuphi aapki chinn gayi hai rida<br />
wo dekhe koi aa raha hai idhar<br />
phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>3. Koi teer chupkar chala de kahi&#39;n<br />
phuphi zalimo ka bharosa nahi<br />
qasam khake kehti hu besheer ki<br />
mai gardan pe rokungi teer e laee&#39;n<br />
ke ab aagaya hai mujhe ye hunar<br />
phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>4. Mai karti hu pehre ki zidd is liye<br />
sina par shaheedo ke sar hai rakhe<br />
zara der to door se hi sahi<br />
nazar aa hi jayenge baba mujhe<br />
nigaaho se chumungi baba ka sarr<br />
phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>

<p>5. Ye akbar guzarish thi masoom ki<br />
meri kamsini ko na dekhe phuphi<br />
abhi apne bhai ko ro lijiye<br />
hume kal se mohlat na denge shaqi<br />
qareeb aane wala hai waqt e sahar<br />
phuphi mujhse pehra badal lijiye</p>
